{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/newham-council-best-value-notice-may-2025","content_id":"682d6ef4-e1d5-4df4-a4f2-404e37c9fd42","description":"Best Value Notices issued to Newham Council on 8 May 2025 and 15 July 2026.  ","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a572b446d6d5c7e2845c968","filename":"Newham_Council_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":219770,"filename":"Newham_Council_Best_Value_Notice.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9394590","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Newham Council: Best Value Notice (July 2026)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a572b446d6d5c7e2845c968/Newham_Council_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"681b73893f1c73824ee3e53f","filename":"Newham_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":183676,"filename":"Newham_Best_Value_Notice.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9393086","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Newham Council: Best Value Notice (May 2025)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/681b73893f1c73824ee3e53f/Newham_Best_Value_Notice.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 8 May 2025, the Minister for Local Government and English Devolution, Jim McMahon OBE MP, announced in written ministerial statement the issuing of a non-statutory best value notice to Newham Council.</p>\n\n<p>On 15 July 2026, the Minister for Local Government and Homelessness, Alison McGovern MP, announced in a written ministerial statement that a revised Best Value Notice was being issued to Newham Council, to be reviewed after 6 months.</p>\n\n<p>Best Value Notices are a formal notification that the department has concerns regarding an authority and request that the authority provides the department with assurance of improvement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Announcement that a revised Best Value Notice is being issued to Newham Council, to be reviewed after 6 months.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T14:07:24Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-05-08T10:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9394590","9393086"],"first_public_at":"2025-05-08T11:00:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2025-05-08T11:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/newham-council-best-value-notice-may-2025","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/newham-council-best-value-notice-may-2025","base_path":"/government/publications/newham-council-best-value-notice-may-2025","content_id":"682d6ef4-e1d5-4df4-a4f2-404e37c9fd42","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-15T14:07:24Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Newham Council: Best Value Notice","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/newham-council-best-value-notice-may-2025","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/best-value-notices-for-local-authorities","api_url":"https://www.gov.